:: Carter House Leaving Late Low Fun [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<if _swimstate == 1>>
    <<unapplyEventOutfit>>
<</if>>
Unsure of what to do next, you and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> end up just lying on the ground out of boredom when his father suddenly walks in and knocks twice on the wall. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sorry to end… whatever this is, but it’s about time for <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span> to head home.”</span> <br>
<br> 
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Already!?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> instantly snaps up with a shocked expression. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Yeah, it’s just about dinner time. Plus, he should really get home before it gets too dark.”</span> His father replies. <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Frown",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Carter",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Eyes: "Sad",
                Blush: 1,
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“B- but we’ve hardly done anything yet!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> complains, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Can’t he stay a little longer, pretty please?”</span> The boy begs, but his dad doesn’t cave. <span style="Color: LightCoral">Unfortunately, it is time for you to go, despite <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> not really having a lot of fun. He pouts and sighs, but eventually the two of you stand and clean up a little before he leads you to the door.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sorry, I’m glad you came but…”</span> He shrugs, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I just felt like we didn’t get to have that much fun. Not your fault though.”</span> He looks up and gives you a partial smile, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I hope you come over again soon though. We’ll have some real fun to make up for this time! Promise! I’ll see you at school, bye!”</span> He gives you a wave as you walk out the door. <span style="Color: LightCoral">You feel a bit bad that <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> didn’t have much fun, but that just happens sometimes.</span> <br>
<<socialChange "Carter" -5>>
<br>
